WEBVTT

00:10:26.268 --> 00:10:30.070
at work, at school, at home.

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:32.429
I'm asking you to look at the people around you

00:10:32.429 --> 00:10:35.050
purposefully and intentionally.

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:36.493
Invite people into your life

00:10:36.493 --> 00:10:39.329
who don't look like you, don't think like you,

00:10:39.329 --> 00:10:40.624
don't act like you,

00:10:40.624 --> 00:10:42.585
don't come from where you come from,

00:10:42.585 --> 00:10:45.235
and you might find that they
will challenge your assumptions

00:10:45.235 --> 00:10:46.991
and make you grow as a person.

00:10:46.991 --> 00:10:49.331
You might get powerful new insights

00:10:49.331 --> 00:10:50.954
from these individuals,

00:10:50.954 --> 00:10:54.140
or, like my husband, who happens to be white,

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:56.210
you might learn that black people,

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:57.767
men, women, children,

00:10:57.767 --> 00:11:00.656
we use body lotion every single day.